taurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants, Soup","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","review_id":"UuF7HVyW8G0aQy1y0_pyNg","date":"2015-10-13T17:41:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9450882077217102,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I dined at the Blue Crab with another couple on a Saturday night. Let me just say that the location is on point. It's the old Landry's Seafood (or so I was told), and the bottom of the building is open and there was live music outside. There is also seating down there along with outside seating on a deck that's level with the second floor. We went inside to get a table and was told it would be an hour. So, we got a little buzzer then made our way to the bar to wait for the other couple to arrive. We had drinks - the bar had the basics and a couple of specialty cocktails. I just had wine and the hubster had a beer. The service was fast and attentive at the bar even though th..."},{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","review_id":"KFGnk4-djNCIQgBJkqWamA","date":"2016-01-11T03:17:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445297718048096,"text_excerpt":"This place has great seafood. I had the fried oyster and grilled shrimp combo and it was wonderful. We also got the bbq shrimp with a biscuit and the onion rings. I can't wait to come back!!"},{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","review_id":"q1RpBFdkDVDVlOuraRiNcg","date":"2016-01-10T04:51:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430849552154541,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by on a Friday night around 6:30 and the place was packed. The hostesses were kind of disinterested and told my party that the wait was 45 minutes. We decided to wait in the bar, and when we did, we noticed that the back balcony had only a couple of people sitting on it. This made sense as the weather was kind of cold and dreary, but the hostess never even mentioned that this was available. After seeing it being fairly unoccupied we inquired with the hostess about sitting on it, and we were allowed to do so. Great view from the balcony. The food was excellent and the service was too. We had raw oysters that were fresh and tasty. I had a shrimp cocktail and the crab cakes (both app..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","photo_id":"BcjzhyDQV3ENaUW8jNbPPQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BcjzhyDQV3ENaUW8jNbPPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8645358085632324},{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","photo_id":"6txrE3-RXySf3I34yu0TxA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/6txrE3-RXySf3I34yu0TxA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8299287557601929},{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","photo_id":"jmMEdXWcSPmqt0sjHeh89g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jmMEdXWcSPmqt0sjHeh89g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8014430999755859},{"business_id":"0g9XB5iLNje1B4UNbzqCPA","phot